\begin{enumerate}
\item
  \textbf{Question}\\
  Sabendo que \(P(X \leq x) = 1-\exp(-\lambda x)\), e \(F(7)=0.689\),
  qual é a variância dessa variável aleatória?

  \begin{enumerate}
  \def\labelenumii{(\alph{enumii})}
  \item
    \(0.03\)
  \item
    \(0.17\)
  \item
    \(5.99\)
  \item
    \(71.84\)
  \item
    \(35.92\)
  \end{enumerate}

  \textbf{Solution}\\
  Para encontrar o valor de \(\lambda\), basta resolver:
  \[\begin{aligned}
  \exp(-7 \lambda)&=0.311\\
  -7 \lambda &=ln(0.311) \\
  \lambda&=\frac{-ln(0.311)}{7}=0.1669.
  \end{aligned}\] Portanto, \(X \sim \text{Exp}(0.1669)\), e
  \[Var(X)=\frac{1}{\lambda^2}=\frac{1}{0.0278}=35.9201698053302.\]

  \begin{enumerate}
  \def\labelenumii{(\alph{enumii})}
  \item
    Falso
